% NY N360066 (March 2026): a cat toy from China.
scenario ny_n360066 is:
    the Pom Pom Launcher is a manufactured article, as stated in ruling NY N360066.
    the Pom Pom Launcher is a set put up for retail sale, as stated in ruling NY N360066.
    the launcher of the Pom Pom Launcher is a component of the Pom Pom Launcher, as stated in ruling NY N360066.
    the pom pom balls of the Pom Pom Launcher is a component of the Pom Pom Launcher, as stated in ruling NY N360066.
    the launcher of the Pom Pom Launcher is made of plastics, as stated in ruling NY N360066.
    the essential character of the Pom Pom Launcher is given by the launcher of the Pom Pom Launcher,
        according to CBP, as stated in ruling NY N360066,
        because "the launcher gives the essential character by bulk, weight, value and importance to the set".
    the principal use of the Pom Pom Launcher is household use,
        according to CBP, as stated in ruling NY N360066,
        because "plastic pet toys used by domestic animals are household articles (Hartz Mountain Corp. v. United States, 19 CIT 1149)".
    the Pom Pom Launcher is claimed to belong to toys of heading 9503, as stated in ruling NY N360066.
    the claim that the Pom Pom Launcher belongs to toys of heading 9503 is rejected,
        according to CBP, as stated in ruling NY N360066,
        because "Chapter 95 note 5: heading 9503 does not cover articles identifiable as intended exclusively for animals".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the Pom Pom Launcher is 3924.90"].

