% NY N340223 (May 2024): a plastic mat from China.
scenario ny_n340223 is:
    the kitchen rug M516 is a manufactured article, as stated in ruling NY N340223.
    the kitchen rug M516 is a composite good, as stated in ruling NY N340223.
    the coated nonwoven layer of the kitchen rug M516 is a component of the kitchen rug M516, as stated in ruling NY N340223.
    the rubber foam back of the kitchen rug M516 is a component of the kitchen rug M516, as stated in ruling NY N340223.
    the coated nonwoven layer of the kitchen rug M516 is made of plastics,
        according to the CBP laboratory, as stated in ruling NY N340223,
        because "a man-made nonwoven fabric coated, covered, impregnated or laminated with poly(ether-ester urethane)".
    the essential character of the kitchen rug M516 is given by the coated nonwoven layer of the kitchen rug M516,
        according to CBP, as stated in ruling NY N340223,
        because "the coated layer performs the primary role of cushioning; the rubber back only prevents sliding".
    the principal use of the kitchen rug M516 is household use,
        according to CBP, as stated in ruling NY N340223,
        because "the mat is designed and marketed for household use".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the kitchen rug M516 is 3924.90"].

